{
  "name": "ondra-persona-workshop",
  "description": "空谷 Ondra 的人格包工坊（L9 扩展池）：对既有 .skill.zip 人设包做八项元数据体检（id 与包名、文件登记、SKILL.md 篇幅、六槽位覆盖、触发词、硬红线、档案字段、版权声明），并出派生草案（改哪个文件哪个位置、新包骨架、必须自己定的三件事）。全程只读：不写人设包、不生成 ZIP、不生成文案、不判「像不像」。",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "types": "lib/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./src/*": "./src/*",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/**/*.js",
    "lib/**/*.d.ts",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "license": "AGPL-3.0",
  "ondra": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~",
    "@types/node": "22.20.1"
  }
}
